Now that I've got a few ascensions I've started trying conducts. Genoless  
is easy enough, as is polyself and polypile-less. Still yet to try !geno,  
!poly, !wish all in one go...

So, start up a gnomish healer, to try out pacifism conduct. Have a few  
food issues, but Hermes seems quite willing to fill my tummy. Before  
minetown I have a bag of some sort, magic whistle, key, pick-axe and a  
nice stack of gold. Cleared the minetown general store and bought loads of  
protection. Things are going well. Head out of the mines, then off to the  
